---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy & Cookie Policy | ApprovedTilers.co.uk" description="Our privacy and cookie policy.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy & Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
    
    <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>When you request a quote, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and postcode. This is strictly used to provide you with an accurate estimate and to connect you with our vetted local tilers.</p>
    
    <h3>2. How We Use Cookies</h3>
    <p>We use essential cookies to ensure our website functions correctly. We also use minimal analytics cookies to understand how visitors interact with our website. You can disable these in your browser settings.</p>
    
    <h3>3. Data Sharing</h3>
    <p>We do not sell your data. Your contact details are only shared securely with the assigned master tiler who will be conducting your home survey or providing the service.</p>
    
    <h3>4. Your Rights</h3>
    <p>You have the right to request access to or deletion of your personal data at any time. Please contact us via our Contact page for any privacy-related requests.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
